    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d110-a5">

                <pb facs="0204" n="96" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg96"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5 in No. 122.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Capt. Picking to Mr.
                            Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">U.
                                S. Cruiser Charleston</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio de
                                Janeiro, Brazil</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-12-24"><hi rendition="#italic">December 24,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your communication of the 22d instant. I acted on your advice once, very much
                    to my regret ever since. I have informed you of this verbally heretofore.</p>
                <p>I am, sir,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry F. Picking.</hi><lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Captain, U. S. Navy,<lb/>Commanding U. S. Naval
                            Forces, South Atlantic Station.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
